silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_03_cite_as_kleisli_arrow_yoneda_hom_leg_1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "CiteKleisliLegEtaWitnessExample" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_03_cite_as_kleisli_arrow_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'CiteKleisliLegEtaWitness', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, JoC §6.20: The unit eta_C: C -> Free(Sigma)(C) is the cite map; cite = eta applied at Witness type. cite(mittensVetRecord77) = eta_Witness(mittensVetRecord77) is the single-step Kleisli composition with no preceding g." .
